ADSMOD operational database schema baseline.

`versions/20261021_current_schema.py` is the single root revision and creates
the current ORM schema for a fresh SQLite or PostgreSQL database. Historical
revision files were removed; databases stamped with those revisions fail
closed and must be recreated. Startup does not drop or replace existing data.

Update the baseline only as part of an intentional schema reset. Review its
DDL against `server.repositories.schemas.models.Base.metadata` and validate
fresh SQLite initialization plus PostgreSQL schema compilation.
